; Synthetic fixture: one named block holding three anonymous trips. Cavern
; builds no naming level for an anonymous *begin, so the trips share alpha's
; namespace and tie at "tie" (trips 1 and 2) and "hub" (all three).
*begin alpha
*data normal from to tape compass clino

*begin ; Trip 1
*date 2020.01.11
*team "Ann Example" instruments
*calibrate declination 1.5
*fix a1 1000 2000 300
a1 a2 5.0 20 0
a2 tie 5.0 30 0
a2 hub 5.0 40 0
*end

*begin ; Trip 2
*date 2020.02.22
*team "Bob Sample" notes
*calibrate declination 2.5
*begin
*flags duplicate
tie b9 3.0 50 0
*end
tie b1 5.0 60 0
b1 hub 5.0 70 0
*end

*begin
*flags splay
*data normal from to tape compass clino
*end

*begin ; Trip 3
*date 2020.03.30
*team "Cy Placeholder" tape
*calibrate declination 3.5
hub c1 5.0 80 0
c1 c2 5.0 90 0
*end

c2 z1 4.0 100 0

*end alpha
